@api = http://localhost:5023

### 1. Words that aren't in the documents
POST {{api}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "My parcel arrived broken. What should I do?" }

### 2. Needs two documents: Norway is Zone B, but alcohol isn't shipped there
POST {{api}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Can I send a bottle of wine to my friend in Oslo?" }

### 3. Trap: returns have 30 days, damage claims 14
POST {{api}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "How long do I have to send back a jacket I don't like?" }

### 4. Not in the documents: it must say so
POST {{api}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Do you deliver to Japan?" }

### 5. Another language
POST {{api}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Hasarlı paket için kaç gün içinde başvurmalıyım?" }